'''SUPERFEST''' is a [[:Category:Gacha Event|Gacha Event]] in [[The Battle Cats Unite!]]. This event includes all common pools, [[:Category:Busters Events|Buster]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]], "Limited Edition" [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cats]], and "Reinforcements" Super Rare Cats. Only available in the '''Japanese''' ('''JP''')  and '''International''' ('''WW''') versions, the banner is available after beating the stage [[Cosmic Lounge (Cats of the Cosmos)|Cosmic Lounge]] and is <u>available at all times</u>.

Though added initially in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]], it did not replace [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] until the [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.7 Update|September 15, 2023 Update Patch.]] On September 15, 2023, [[Shadow Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Shadow Gao]] was added to the banner. On December 15, 2023, [[Miko Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|Miko Mitama]] and [[Dark Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|Dark Mitama]] were added into the pool. On March 15, 2024, [[D'artanyan (Uber Rare Cat)|D'artanyan]] and [[D'arktanyan (Uber Rare Cat)|D'arktanyan]] were added to the banner. The International version later received this banner to replace UBERFEST on December 15, 2025.
